* SPICE netlist for given schematic

M1 3 7 8 8 PMOS
M2 2 5 2 2 NMOS
M3 2 6 2 2 NMOS
M4 3 4 6 6 NMOS

VDD 8 0 DC 5V

* Node Mapping:
* 1 - Not used
* 2 - A, Drain of M2 and M3
* 3 - Y (output)
* 4 - φ (gate of M4)
* 5 - B (gate of M2)
* 6 - C (gate of M3), Source of M4
* 7 - φ (gate of M1)
* 8 - VDD

.END